Hunting For CORS vulnerabilities :

1- Maping the application 
- Walk through all the pages on the application 
- See if there is a CORS headers used by the application 

2- Test the applicationfor dynamic generation 
- Does it reflect the uder-supplied ACAO header "Access Control Allow Origin" ?
->> Change The origin header and see if it reflected back to you 
- Does it only validate on the start/end of a specific string ? 
->> Add a few letters to the begining of the string and see if server accepts it
- Does it allow the null Origin ?
- Does it restrict the protocol ?
->> If the application uses https make it http and see if it allows
- Does it allow credentials ?
